The prompt-overlap policy through the generated dispatch: under
PromptOverlapRefuse a second prompt for a session whose turn is running is
answered -32603 naming the table's session key, without calling the handler,
and a prompt after session/cancel runs though the cancelled handler has not
returned; under PromptOverlapConcurrent both
prompts reach the handler and one session/cancel cancels both
(0021-PLAN-resolve-issues-4-and-5-before-v1-14-0.md, step 3).

